    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Hi @detrout, you can enable debug with `NUMBA_DEBUGINFO=1`. See https://numba.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/envvars.html#envvar-NUMBA_DEBUGINFO\r\n\r\nAlso, it might be good to disable LLVM optmizer with `NUMBA_OPT=0`.",
