  {
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "I didn't remember seeing progress, but I've been pretty distracted as of late\n\nI found my bug report to debian which hasn't been closed.\n\nhttps://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1070102\n\nIt looks like the llvmlite maintainer tried to update to llvmlite to 0.43 using llvm-15, but llvm-15 has since been removed, \n\nIt looks like right now in Debian's unstable repository we've got:\n\nllvm-14\nllvm-17\nllvm-18\nllvm-19\n\nI am also trying to building llvmlite and numby to seeing if it got fixed and someone forgot to close the bug.",
